  title: 'White Label SEO Philippines | SEO Outsourcing for Agencies',
  description: 'White label SEO for agencies: audits, technical work, content and reports produced by our Philippines team under your brand. Your client deals only with you.',
  h1: 'White Label SEO Services for Agencies',
  crumb: 'White label SEO',
  enquiry: '/contact/?service=white-label-seo#contactForm',
  lead: [
    'We do the SEO work and you present it as your own. Web design studios, paid media agencies, freelancers and SEO teams with too much on use us for audits, technical fixes, keyword research, content and monthly reports. Your client deals only with you.',
  ],
  secondary: { href: '/samples/technical-review-handoff.csv', label: 'See a sample handoff (CSV)' },
  sections: [
    {
      h2: 'What we deliver under your brand',
      html: `<ul class="bf-list">
<li><a href="/seo-audit-services/">SEO audits</a> and technical reviews</li>
<li><a href="/technical-seo-services-philippines/">Technical fix briefs</a> written for developers</li>
<li>Keyword research and keyword maps</li>
<li><a href="/content-seo-services-philippines/">Page copy, articles and content plans</a></li>
<li>Local SEO: Google Business Profile and citations</li>
<li>Link prospecting and placement reports</li>
<li>Monthly client reports in your template, with a plain-English summary</li>
<li>Notes for your account manager before a client call</li>
