<li><strong>Fit call.</strong> We agree what you sell, to whom, and what you need from us.</li>
<li><strong>Scope and access.</strong> A written scope per client. You grant access through your own accounts.</li>
<li><strong>Work.</strong> Our team delivers in the format and place we agree with you.</li>
<li><strong>Senior review.</strong> A senior SEO checks each deliverable before you see it.</li>
<li><strong>Your sign-off.</strong> You decide what goes to the client.</li>
<li><strong>Monthly report and next month's priorities.</strong></li>
</ol>`,
