    {
      h2: 'The rules we keep',
      html: `<ul class="bf-list">
<li>Client contact stays with your agency unless you and we explicitly agree otherwise.</li>
<li>The work is delivered under your brand.</li>
<li>Every major recommendation comes with its evidence.</li>
<li>We tell you when a client asks for something risky, such as bought links.</li>
<li>Drafts written with AI assistance are edited by a person before they reach you.</li>
</ul>`,
    },
    {
      h2: 'Ways to use us',
      html: `<p>One-off audits; a monthly programme per client; overflow when your own team is full; or a senior second opinion on work you have done. Our article on <a href="/blog/white-label-seo-for-web-design-agencies/">white label SEO for web design agencies</a> explains how the arrangement works in practice.</p>`,
    },
    {
      h2: 'Working hours and markets',
      html: `<p>We work 9:00 to 18:00 Manila time, Monday to Friday, and agree handover and review windows that suit your day. We write British, Australian and American English, and research each client's own country.</p>`,
    },
    {
      h2: 'Pricing',
      html: `<p>We do not publish a rate card. Defined projects, overflow capacity and monthly work per client can be quoted in AUD, GBP or USD, with the deliverables written down before the first task starts.</p>`,
    },
  ],
  faqs: [
    { question: 'Will our clients know?', answer: 'Not from us.' },
    { question: 'Is this the same as hiring a virtual assistant?', answer: 'No. A VA can be useful for task support, but white label SEO delivery needs strategy, prioritisation, quality checks and judgement. We focus on work your agency can confidently present to clients, with evidence behind recommendations and senior SEO review before delivery.' },
    { question: 'Which currencies do you quote in?', answer: 'AUD, GBP or USD, agreed with the scope before work starts.' },
